(1375, 604, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1376, 604, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
(1377, 604, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '4'),
(1378, 604, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Many companies are afraid of turning to a brand. The reason could be the fear of failure. But when you have experienced branding agency ready to help you, the process is flawless.'),
(1379, 611, '_edit_last', '1'),
(1380, 611, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '60'),
(1381, 611, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '4'),
(1382, 611, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'While the branding process helps in understanding the culture, culture adds value to the brand. Brand and culture, when blended, can connect better with customers.'),
(1383, 616, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1384, 616, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '90'),
(1385, 616, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '13'),
(1386, 616, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'How effectively can you use the rainbow in graphic design?'),
(1387, 616, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Nowadays, many graphic designers are incorporating rainbow colours into their designs to make them appealing and eye-catching. In this article, we will explain how amazingly you can use rainbow colours in your graphic design.'),
(1388, 624, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1389, 624, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'These days, graphic designs play an imperative role in marketing and branding efforts. To illustrate this statement, we are going to mention some important statistics from design and marketing organizations that every business should know if they want to stand out in a crowded marketplace.'),
(1390, 624, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '60'),
(1391, 624, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '4'),
(1392, 624, '_yoast_wpseo_focuskw', 'branding agency'),
(1393, 624, '_yoast_wpseo_linkdex', '48'),
(1394, 631, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1395, 631, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
(1396, 631, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '11'),
(1397, 631, '_yoast_wpseo_title', '6 common logo design problems that your business may face'),
(1398, 631, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Creating a logo is a very facile and simple job these days but there are still some cases when graphic designers commit some common sets of mistakes which can make logos unsightly and gaudy.'),
(1399, 635, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1400, 635, '_yoast_wpseo_focuskw', 'graphic design'),
(1401, 635, '_yoast_wpseo_title', '6 proven reasons why good design plays an important role in your business'),
(1402, 635, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Great design is not only a creative concept or a graphical presentation. Great design is what which can convey the right message to your customers. So, a great and strong design plays a pivotal role in the success of a company.'),
(1403, 635, '_yoast_wpseo_linkdex', '57'),
(1404, 635, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '90'),
(1405, 635, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '13'),
(1406, 642, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1407, 642, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '60'),
(1408, 642, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '4'),
(1409, 642, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'The right corporate identity design will uplift your brands’ prominence'),
(1410, 642, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Designing a unique brand identity will certainly escalate the growth and success of your business, irrespective the nature of business. That’s why companies are taking help from the eminent graphic design companies.'),
(1411, 649, '_edit_last', '3'),
(1412, 649, '_yoast_wpseo_content_score', '30'),
(1413, 649, '_yoast_wpseo_primary_category', '13'),
(1414, 649, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Graphic design includes a multitude of things, from logo to banner to website design, brochures, office stationaries, and many more things that will help you to make a great impression on your customers.');
