(4153, 1240, '_wp_attachment_image_alt', 'Brand building company in Ahmedabad'),
(4155, 728, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Explore insightful blogs on corporate and personal branding, logo design, and brochure design. Get inspired and discover tips to enhance your work and creativity.'),
(4156, 730, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Case Study | Buttercup Advertising studio'),
(4157, 754, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Creation of a new brand | Case Study'),
(4158, 754, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client\'s vision is to deliver international products and service experience to the affluent India consumers by offering a wide range of Gasoline and Diesel products.'),
(4159, 774, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Creation of a Healthy Snacks Brand | Case Study'),
(4160, 774, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Our client is a foodie herself and loves snacking. However she found the lack of availability of healthy snacking options. Many so called health brands in the market are selling products which are not good for the body.'),
(4161, 887, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Rebranded an existing Real estate Company | Case Study'),
(4162, 887, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client was in the Real estate market for many years. They wanted to create a totally different Identity for their new projects.'),
(4163, 887, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4164, 801, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'B2B & B2C Brochure Design for International Aquaculture Brand | Case Study'),
(4165, 801, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Most of the players in the Aquaculture industry were using very generic Brochures. The designs of the different Company were practically indistinguishable from each other. There was no different Concepts used separately to communicate to the B2B and B2C Customers.'),
(4166, 801, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4167, 824, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Complete Branding for a Wellness Product of Canada | Case Study'),
(4168, 824, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Our client wanted to launch a Evapes Brand in the Canadian and International Market. There were different products with various benefits to be launched under the Brand. Considering the overall impression of the product category, the challenge was to communicate the Value Proposition in a COOL way.'),
(4169, 824, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4170, 838, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Created a New Brand Identity for a Real Estate Project | Case Study'),
(4171, 838, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client is an established Real Estate Player in Central India. He wanted to create a project for the upper middle classes because they had limited choice in their city. Either the residential apartments were at the bottom end with sub standard facilities or at the luxury high end.'),
(4172, 848, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Creation of New Brand in the Event Management Market | Case Study'),
(4173, 848, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Housie is a popular game mainly among ladies in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India. Most of the clubs have Sunday Housies with huge participation due to high cash prizes. Our client wanted to create a new housie event which was different from the existing ones.'),
(4174, 861, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Repositioning a Stagnant Brand in the HORECA Segment | Case Study'),
(4175, 861, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The establishment consisted of a disco with a restaurant serving Italian and Mexican food. Footfalls and revenues were declining. In spite of having a wonderful infrastructure, great chefs and quality cuisines, expected sales was not happening.'),
(4537, 1320, '_edit_lock', '1770025767:4'),
(4177, 873, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Created Logo Design for a Crypto Currency Exchange | Case Study'),
(4178, 873, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'A new Crypto Currency Exchange was going to be launched. All over the world, there are hundreds of Crypto currencies, the most famous being Bitcoin. The identity had to be different from the existing players so that it did not get lost in the crowd.'),
(4179, 873, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4538, 1321, '_wp_attached_file', '2025/04/How-to-Build-an-Authentic-Brand-That-People-Trust.png'),
(4182, 785, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Creation of a new Agriculture Brand | Case Study'),
(4183, 785, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'During the full lockdown of Covid, a young man realized that taking safety precautions should not be a forced practice because of the pandemic, but should be a regular thing to do every day, specially related to food.'),
(4184, 880, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Created the Logo Design for a Multi Service IT Company | Case Study'),
(4185, 880, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The IT Company is providing MULTIPLE services! NFT, gaming, and social token suite, allowing creators to monetize their skills. Creating instant content and share across network. Connecting early stage NFT & Gaming innovators with community of investors.'),
(4186, 880, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4187, 893, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Logo Redesign For Laxmi Infra | Case Study'),
(4188, 893, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client did not want a generic infrastructure logo. Most of the players in the market simply used a random symbol or initials of the company name. Our challenge was to do something completely different.'),
(4189, 893, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4190, 898, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Logo, Brand Guidelines, Brochure, Website, LinkedIn creatives | Case Study'),
(4191, 898, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client was operating in the market for around 5 years in the business of Financial Services. He was providing Wealth Management and Investment services and most of his customers were acquired either by personal connections or referrals.'),
(4192, 898, '_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes', '1'),
(4193, 908, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'New Brand Creation for a Wellness Brand of Canada | Case Study'),
(4194, 908, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client based in Canada wanted to launch a new Brand of Essential Oils and launch it in Canadian, European and American Markets. In the already cluttered market, he wanted a fresh approach to make the Brand stand out on shelves.'),
(4195, 966, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Creation of a Stationery Brand | Case Study'),
(4196, 966, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Our client belongs to a traditional business family and runs multiple verticals successfully. Having gained wisdom from years of working in the notebooks industry, he is determined to create a strong brand to be reckoned with.'),
(4197, 949, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Creation of a Hair Oil Brand | Case Study'),
(4198, 949, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'Our client uses natural products himself and avoids brands which contains harmful chemicals. It has been a part of his family tradition to make oil for home use, using indigenous methods, the knowledge of which had been passed down from generations'),
(4199, 933, '_yoast_wpseo_title', 'Personal Branding Document of Entrepreneur for Media Relations | Case Study'),
(4200, 933, '_yoast_wpseo_metadesc', 'The client is a successful entrepreneur in the Agro industry. He has won numerous awards for his contribution to the development of Indian Organic agriculture and the upliftment of farmers. He required a Personal Branding Document for using in Media Communication and Public Relations.'),
(4201, 1244, '_edit_lock', '1770027227:4'),
(4202, 1245, '_wp_attached_file', '2025/03/Social-Media-Branding-Building-an-Engaged-Community.png'),
