r {\n    background: #c0282d;\n}\n', 'buttercup', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'buttercup', '', '', '2025-04-25 09:31:25', '2025-04-25 09:31:25', '', 0, 'https://buttercup.in/buttercup/', 0, 'custom_css', '', 0);
